%description:
Tests dropBeyondWindowEdge, the window-edge check of Linux (tcp_sequence()).
The server offers 2000 bytes from a buffer of 10000 bytes and reads nothing.
After the first 1000 bytes, the highest window edge offered is 2001. The tester
adds 1000 bytes to the second segment, which then ends at 3001: the server drops
it whole, because 1000 unread bytes wait in its receive queue, and the client
sends the data again after its RTO. Without the parameter, the buffer takes the
whole segment.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 2000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.srv_tcp.advertisedWindow = 2000
*.srv_tcp.receiveBufferSize = 10000B
*.srv_tcp.dropBeyondWindowEdge = true
*.srv_app.autoRead=false
*.tcptester.script="A4 data 1000"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 1000 
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1001:3001(2000) ack 501 win 16384 # adding data
[1.207 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 1000 
[2.205 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1001:2001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[2.407 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
The segment ends beyond the highest window edge offered (2001): dropping it
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
